@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@orderId = replace-with-pending-payment-order-id
@paymentNo = replace-after-create
@timestamp = replace-with-current-millis
@nonce = replace-with-random-nonce
@signature = replace-with-hmac-sha256-signature

### 1. 用户登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800000001",
  "password": "Test123456"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("userToken", response.body.data.token);
%}

### 2. 为本人 PENDING_PAYMENT 订单创建支付单
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/create
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": {{orderId}},
  "channel": "MOCK"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("paymentNo", response.body.data.paymentNo);
%}

### 3. 查询支付单
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/{{paymentNo}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 4. mock-pay 成功回调
### signature 原文按 paymentNo、success、timestamp、nonce 以换行符连接，
### 使用 smart-ticket.payment.mock-callback-secret 做 HMAC-SHA256 后转十六进制。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/mock-pay
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentNo": "{{paymentNo}}",
  "success": true,
  "timestamp": {{timestamp}},
  "nonce": "{{nonce}}",
  "signature": "{{signature}}"
}

### 5. 查询订单，应收敛为 PAID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 说明
### POST /api/orders/{id}/pay 已废弃，不能绕过 payment_order 直接修改订单状态。
